" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/how-to-become-an-seo-specialist.webp\" alt=\"how to become an seo specialist?\" class=\"wp-image-9706\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/how-to-become-an-seo-specialist.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/how-to-become-an-seo-specialist-300x198.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/how-to-become-an-seo-specialist-768x508.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/how-to-become-an-seo-specialist-150x99.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The following are the tips to learn how to be expert in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a> and master its concepts to make a promising career in the field.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understand How Search Engines Work<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Learn SEO Basics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Take an Online Course<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow Industry Experts<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Get Familiar with SEO Tools<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Expand Your Network<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gain Hands-on Experience<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stay Consistent and Informed<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Build a Solid Portfolio<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Understand How Search Engines Work<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The first step to mastering SEO and becoming a skilled professional is to become familiar with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/search-engine-functions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">how a search engine works<\/a>. Many people directly jump to joining a course or watching advanced tutorials, but that\u2019s the wrong way to learn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It\u2019s recommended to understand how search engines analyze web pages to rank them in SERPs. Also, you must know search engine algorithms and factors that affect a website rankings. You should learn the three main search engine processes:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Crawling refers to discovering web pages and content on the internet.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Indexing that search engines use to organize web pages and content.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ranking refers to how and where a website will appear in SERPs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Learn the intricacies of optimizing websites and content so search engines can find, read, and index them easily for search engine ranking results.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Learn SEO Basics<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>As an SEO aspirant, you must already have knowledge of SEO fundamentals. However, you need to delve deeper into SEO because it is more than links and keywords. Driving organic traffic is one of the primary goals of SEO. The real objective of SEO is to provide a seamless and memorable user experience.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You must understand <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">technical SEO<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">on-page SEO<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/off-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">off-page SEO<\/a>. Learn about different <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-types\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">types of SEO<\/a> tactics, marketing platforms, tools, and more. You must also know how to drive organic traffic and convert visitors into paying clients. Moreover, you need to offer prospects what they want.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Get insights into metadata, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/keyword-research-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">keyword research<\/a>, optimization, analytics, etc. Know the guidelines and best practices to follow at every step of the SEO process. Master smaller aspects of SEO and then move to the more advanced and creative elements.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/backlinks-types\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Types of Backlinks in SEO (15 Different Off-Page Backlinks Types)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Take an Online Course<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Now that you have started your SEO journey, it\u2019s time to take it up a notch. There were days when people had to watch tutorials and read books to learn SEO, as there were no proper classes or courses.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Fortunately, you have ample online and offline sources to learn SEO. Join a reliable <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=traffic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO course online<\/a> to learn from industry leaders and seek professional guidance. You will work on multiple hands-on projects and get a sneak peek into how the industry works.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are various options to choose from:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You can start with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/content-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">content marketing<\/a> to learn how to write SEO-friendly content for different channels.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A complete <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=traffic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO course<\/a> that covers every topic, from basics to advanced. It also offers a plethora of learning materials and resources that you can use to acquire skills and knowledge.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Certification courses help you become job-ready and validate your capabilities as an SEO professional.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Google offers Google certification for aspirants seeking online training.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Follow Industry Experts<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Don\u2019t restrict your knowledge. Get access to all the resources and material you can to hone your skills. And what\u2019s a better way to improve your skills than to follow industry leaders and experts who have proved their excellence?&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Follow SEO professionals on LinkedIn, listen to their podcasts, read their blogs, and watch tutorials to know the SEO sector closely and prepare for it. You will understand the challenges to expect and the benefits of stepping into the sector.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are a lot of online communities and events that guide beginners on how to be an SEO professional. Attend them, ask questions, share your ideas, and learn from the experiences of others.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Follow people on social media to stay updated with the industry trends and attend their online sessions for helpful advice.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n          